+| `TINYCBOR_ROOT` | `TARGET_OS=linux` | Probed: `./tinycbor` |
+| `CURL_ROOT` | `TARGET_OS=linux` | Probed: `/usr/local`, `/usr`, plus `../curl-install` and `/opt/curl` when `TLS=wolfssl` |
+| `OPENSSL3_ROOT` | `TLS=openssl` | Not probed; must be set |
+| `WOLFSSL_ROOT` | `TLS=wolfssl`, or `TPM_STACK=wolftpm` on any backend | Probed: `../wolfssl-install`, `/opt/wolfssl`, `/usr/local` |
+| `WOLFTPM_ROOT` | `TPM_STACK=wolftpm` | Optional; only needed if wolfTPM is outside the default compiler/linker paths |
